TurboMind GEMM core, vendored from LMDeploy
============================================

Origin
- Upstream project: LMDeploy, https://github.com/InternLM/lmdeploy
  (TurboMind, src/turbomind). Copyright (c) OpenMMLab. Apache License 2.0
  (see LICENSE in this directory).
- Upstream commit: NOT RECORDED. The fork imported this tree in ee0bc6a87
  ("[Core] Add SM70 V100 migration paths") and modified it afterwards
  (last touches e64d39aa7, e150e9da8, de0dd17fb, ...). It does not name the
  lmdeploy commit it started from.
- Immediate source: charlie-horse/vLLM (a fork of 1CatAI/1Cat-vLLM),
  commit cf9492a01, path csrc/sm70_turbomind/lmdeploy/.

What is here
- 105 files, the #include closure of the TurboMind GEMM translation units
  that the fork compiled (fork CMakeLists.txt:381-405), kept at their
  lmdeploy-relative paths under src/turbomind/. Files that nothing includes
  (the sm90/sm80 mainloops, cuda_type_utils, bf16 fallbacks, ...) were left
  out.
- The 1Cat SM70 changes in these files (V100 tile configs, NVFP4/FP8
  converters, GGUF hooks in config_sm70_s884.h/transform.h/types.h) are kept
  as the fork has them.

Local modifications (vllm-sm70), listed per file in ../PROVENANCE.md:
- kernels/gemm/kernel/sm70_884_4.cu, sm70_884_8.cu: kernel registrations
  deleted (GGUF, MXFP4, U8 affine, two Qwen3.8-TP4 NVFP4 entries). The
  AWQ/int4 blocks are guarded by VLLM_SM70_TM_AWQ.
- Every other file is byte-identical to fork cf9492a01.

LICENSE in this directory is LMDeploy's own LICENSE (Apache License 2.0,
